7f20f&oh=00_AQR0sgP7j5lRfdsGv00u7G2gFNBXcVvxyQNIg0W9x3zM3Q&oe=6B09CEA8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape 2560x1440px.png", "id": "952628337349594", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819417_952628340682927_7092126336638068634_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zAV_R4wGvAQ7kNvwFon3Jn&_nc_oc=AdpyyLfJsmcL7L0vgYuO1jUslOGkumnIwp7G78qGLIAGvSjEHPsAao9PwkmzXCIWO_M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTJTIWw6b5ifIPHNszgtwX8p3wpSj247bYmhy0FRGJJ0A&oe=6B09C5C7"}, "display_name": "BeatGesture", "keywords": ["rhythm", "music", "beat", "handtracking", "gesture"], "long_description": "Step into a new dimension of rhythm.\n\nBeatGesture is a VR rhythm game where your hands are the controller. Match hand gestures, positions, and timing to the beat for a fully immersive experience.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest hand tracking with stylized, rhythm-driven environments.\n\n{2229418921186635}\n\n[Gesture-Based Gameplay] \n\nHit incoming notes by matching the correct hand shape, placing your hand in the right position, and timing it perfectly with the music. Simple to learn, deeply satisfying to master.\n\n[Expressive Controls]\n\nPlay using natural gestures like fists, open hands, thumbs up, and L-shapes. Direction-based variations and two-hand patterns add depth and challenge.\n\n[Dynamic Note Types]\n\nTap \u2013 Hit on beat\n\nHold \u2013 Maintain your gesture\n\nSwipe \u2013 Hit the note in the arrow direction\n\n\n[Game Modes]\n\nCampaign \u2013 Progress through increasingly challenging stages\n\nFree Play \u2013 Replay songs with selectable difficulty\n\nPassthrough support available.\n\nFeel the beat.\n\nYour hands are the instrument.\n", "short_description": "Feel the rhythm with your hands.\nMatch gestures, hit the beat, and master immersive VR rhythm gameplay in BeatGesture."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http